  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"terminal#16629\", \"terminal#9958\", \"terminal#10488\"], \"answer\": \"This has been reported before. Open dropdowns in the Settings UI (for example Startup > Default profile) detach and scroll outside the Terminal window when you scroll the page. The older reports (#9958 and #10488) were closed as duplicates of the original tracking issue #9320. The most recent report, #16629, says the behavior came back as a regression after the fix in #10922. In that ticket a maintainer suspects an event handler was dropped somewhere, and the issue is not marked as fixed. As a workaround, close the dropdown before you scroll the settings page. You can also thumbs-up the existing issues rather than filing a new one.\"}",
